-11-09",12,"今日安静，无重要安全事件","2026-11-10",13,"GPUStack v2.2.0 之前认证绕过漏洞已被在野利用","2026-11-11",14,"Chrome XML 双重释放漏洞 CVE-2026-125350 已被在野利用","2026-11-12",15,"ConnectWise 调查针对 MSP 的 ScreenConnect 恶意软件活动，47 家组织受影响","2026-11-13",16,"攻击者利用 4,837 个劫持 GitHub 账户在 1,806+ 个仓库运行 CI 密钥窃取器","2026-11-14",17,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用","2026-11-21",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","2026-11-22",25,"CISA 将 Apache Roller、Cisco Expressway、SAP NetWeaver 和 VMware vCenter 四项漏洞列入 KEV","2026-11-23",26,"Artifex Ghostscript -dSAFER 沙箱绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-125396 已复现","2026-11-24",27,"GT13 攻击活动入侵 Check Point Security Management Servers，至少影响 22 家组织","2026-11-25",28,"BabidiGhost 借助越狱 AI 代理攻击欧洲多行业机构并窃取 8.6 GB 档案","2026-11-26",29,"GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链 CVE-2026-129242 等已复现","2026-11-27",30,"Drupal 安装器补丁遗漏导致 CVE-2026-136716 已被在野利用","2026-11-28",31,"DIVD 内网入侵复盘：Zammad 漏洞与 ARP 欺骗注入 PostgreSQL 数据包",32,"Ubuntu 更新 Apache HTTP Server 漏洞并修复重定向 Cookie 回归问题","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-06","generatedAt","2026-11-06T00:00:10.784Z","lead",{"_57":73,"_320":226},"leadItemId","wlm5bqo3onughth3q45scdo59","overview","highlights",[317,318,319],"sections",[217,218,219,220],"flashes",[177,178,179],"cover",{"_170":171,"_172":173,"_174":-5,"_175":-5,"_176":-5},"metrics",{"_165":81,"_166":75,"_167":168,"_169":50},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased",0,"firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/b2ebe5e93a60c0bf.webp","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/5541e3a8200183e1.webp 720w, /dailyinfo/media/058bdbe28ca7c0e5.webp 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/b2ebe5e93a60c0bf.webp 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_180":209,"_57":210,"_183":211,"_185":212,"_187":213,"_189":214,"_191":215,"_193":216,"_195":196,"_197":198},{"_180":201,"_57":202,"_183":203,"_185":204,"_187":205,"_189":206,"_191":207,"_193":208,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":52,"_200":68},{"_180":181,"_57":182,"_183":184,"_185":186,"_187":188,"_189":190,"_191":192,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":52,"_200":62},"itemId","laakttrd05itv4q9m1wlul5oo","TianoCore 披露 EDK II PXE 驱动漏洞 CVE-2026-97631，CVSS 9.5","summary","TianoCore 披露 EDK II PXE 网络启动驱动漏洞 CVE-2026-97631，CVSS 4.0 评分 9.5，IPv4 与 IPv6 handler 均因 504 字节字段的拷贝边界错误而可遭越界写入。","sourceName","安全客","sourceUrl","https://www.anquanke.com/post/id/316426","publishedAt","2026-11-05T03:28:56.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/e78ac72a39cb0522.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/7fa058ce21317a21.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/e78ac72a39cb0522.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"otherSources","followUp","rbs5a4cooic8qrwid6xbbqk1h","Zyxel GS1900 交换机补丁遗漏漏洞 CVE-2026-107441，10 个固件版本仍受影响","Binarly 分析发现，Zyxel GS1900 交换机的 CVE-2026-107441 是 Web 管理程序中的越界写漏洞，Zyxel 评分为 8.8，Binarly 评分为 9.8；双方对利用前提存在分歧。","Infosecurity Magazine","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/zyxel-gs1900-patch-missed-flaw/","2026-11-05T15:15:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w","aza6eimfkt52zsrd63mp6skub","Amadeus 遭网络攻击致亚洲六大航空公司客户数据泄露","IT 供应商 Amadeus 遭网络攻击后，日本航空、国泰航空、大韩航空、韩亚航空、新加坡航空和马来西亚航空确认客户数据泄露。","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95393","2026-11-05T16:55:15.297Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w",{"_221":302,"_183":-5,"_223":303},{"_221":240,"_183":-5,"_223":241},{"_221":229,"_183":-5,"_223":230},{"_221":222,"_183":-5,"_223":224},"label","AI 安全","items",[225],{"_180":150,"_57":73,"_183":226,"_185":212,"_187":227,"_189":228,"_191":215,"_193":216,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":52},"OpenAI 使用尚未发布的网络安全模型和 AI Agent 流水线扫描 Linux 内核，在 10 天内发现、复现并利用 948 个独立本地提权漏洞，总花费 120万美元。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95365","2026-11-05T01:42:25.753Z","研究与披露",[231],{"_180":232,"_57":233,"_183":234,"_185":235,"_187":236,"_189":237,"_191":238,"_193":239,"_195":196,"_197":198},"aeb809z3vyorh7x5j0588tlw3","Check Point Research 揭示 ChatGPT Lockdown Mode 绕过漏洞","Check Point Research 发现 ChatGPT HTML 页面预览的沙箱绕过漏洞，可绕过 Lockdown Mode 窃取完整聊天历史与上传文件，并通过伪造窗口投递恶意软件或窃取凭据。","Check Point Research","https://research.checkpoint.com/2026/chatgpt-lockdown-mode-bypass-phishing-malware-delivery-and-silent-data-exfiltration/","2026-11-05T14:00:11.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/eb5a4204ed5bdd38.webp","/dailyinfo/media/847ca4554cd8d31b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/eb5a4204ed5bdd38.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249],{"_180":298,"_57":299,"_183":300,"_185":212,"_187":301,"_189":214,"_191":215,"_193":216,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":50},{"_180":292,"_57":293,"_183":294,"_185":295,"_187":296,"_189":297,"_191":-5,"_195":196,"_197":198},{"_180":287,"_57":288,"_183":289,"_185":186,"_187":290,"_189":291,"_191":192,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_197":198},{"_180":279,"_57":280,"_183":281,"_185":282,"_187":283,"_189":284,"_191":285,"_193":286,"_195":196,"_197":198},{"_180":271,"_57":272,"_183":273,"_185":274,"_187":275,"_189":276,"_191":277,"_193":278,"_195":196,"_197":198},{"_180":266,"_57":267,"_183":268,"_185":186,"_187":269,"_189":270,"_191":192,"_193":194,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":52},{"_180":258,"_57":259,"_183":260,"_185":261,"_187":262,"_189":263,"_191":264,"_193":265,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":60},{"_180":250,"_57":251,"_183":252,"_185":253,"_187":254,"_189":255,"_191":256,"_193":257,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":52},"k9m1aemrbm2gwfwjok8ooel6i","UNM Health 遭遇网络安全事件，关闭急诊资源并转移患者","UNM Health 在 10 月 26 日遭遇网络安全事件，迫使救护车转向其他医院、取消 30 多家诊所的预约，并暂停部分门诊手术；其 Albuquerque 医院是 New Mexico 唯一的 Level 1 创伤中心。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/202495/security/unm-health-shuts-clinics-and-diverts-patients-during-security-incident.html","2026-11-05T13:48:57.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","a55xwfne2cfqa93ovn0mflfxz","攻击者借 GitHub 分发仿冒 ChatGPT 与 Claude 应用，Yoba 恶意软件借 DLL sideloading 安装挖矿程序","攻击者通过 GitHub Pages 和 GitHub releases 分发仿冒“GPT-5.6 Sol”“GPT-6 Astra”及“Claude Opus”桌面应用。","Hackread","https://hackread.com/fake-chatgpt-claude-apps-software-yoba-malware/","2026-11-05T11:15:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp","/dailyinfo/media/47417cbef4636b7b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp 96w","xkdscbx30se27tz9zmlkauf28","Cathedral使用AI Agent在12小时内渗透Anthropic内部Slack及敏感系统","Cathedral使用自研AI Agent参加Anthropic外部漏洞悬赏测试，从第三方商业软件的漏洞切入，自动扫描并串联权限，12小时内访问销售、人力资源和IT系统，以及会议记录、员工薪资与录用待遇、部分客户联系方式和基础用户账户记录，还进入Slack查看AI模型研发讨论。","https://www.anquanke.com/post/id/316429","2026-11-05T03:32:53.000Z","wfjd5fodjznr45vhjx8weohr1","CERT-In 披露 Crafty Falcon 利用 ARTEX 等 AI 攻击工具攻击印度 BFSI，仿冒 ARTEX 镜像后门暴露 62 个控制台","CERT-In 披露，名为 Crafty Falcon 的 AI 辅助威胁行为者正持续攻击印度 BFSI、加密货币交易所和数字资产服务商，利用 ARTEX、PentAGI、Cairn 和 CyberStrikeAI 自主生成攻击脚本、轮换基础设施并窃取密钥与资金。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/backdoored-docker-image-for-artex-ai.html","2026-11-05T08:42:03.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","dxhu6zoooyev95kp3k297dewf","CrowdStrike 披露攻击者利用公开 PoC 快速武器化漏洞","攻击者正快速把公开漏洞研究改造成可部署的利用工具。CrowdStrike 在 2026 年 1 月至 7 月观察到，公开 PoC 至在野利用的中位时间不足 1 天，最快为 35 分钟，91% 的已观察利用在 PoC 发布后 48 小时内发生。","CrowdStrike","https://www.crowdstrike.com/en-us/blog/adversaries-turn-vulnerability-ecosystem-against-defenders/","2026-11-05T06:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/4bb18fbefa568e31.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f338ab1b3d8b6c40.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/4bb18fbefa568e31.webp 96w","t64dzyrhwjxq4w3f17eo3t1l7","欧洲多国超市冷柜遭远程操控加热，Danfoss 旧固件漏洞被用于攻击","瑞典、爱尔兰、比利时、卢森堡和爱沙尼亚的连锁超市冷柜近期被远程设为50℃，其中SuperValu 223家门店中13家受影响，未出现勒索信且暂无官方归因。此前法国10月11日事件涉及Intermarché约150家门店、Carrefour 80家门店及Monoprix约490家门店中的5%，ANSSI调查指向运行过时固件的Danfoss制冷控制软件。","https://www.anquanke.com/post/id/316435","2026-11-05T03:44:53.000Z","iio02tqqqxbdf0qt1kdr6gjku","Load/Mine 利用 AI 模型仓库植入 GPU 挖矿后门，两波波及 31 个仓库","Load/Mine 活动利用 Transformers 的 trust_remote_code=True 加载恶意模型仓库中的 Python 代码，两波核心活动涉及 31 个仓库、29,818 次下载，计入 13 个仅具技术关联的模型后共 44 个仓库、32,376 次下载。","奇安信威胁情报中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521244&idx=1&sn=e8992e0f55281e055dbc99ffe2538195","2026-11-05T09:07:00.000Z","zty74ssg50q1mndnvfzwhfqfu","Crédit Mutuel Arkéa 遭复杂网络攻击，约 1.33 亿美元疑遭窃取","法国大型银行 Crédit Mutuel Arkéa 证实遭遇高度复杂的网络攻击，攻击者入侵一家未具名服务供应商的平台，并利用银行自有账户向其他银行机构转账，疑经专业平台兑换为加密货币。","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95392","漏洞与在野利用",[304,305],{"_180":311,"_57":312,"_183":313,"_185":314,"_187":315,"_189":316,"_191":-5,"_195":198,"_197":198,"_200":62},{"_180":306,"_57":307,"_183":308,"_185":204,"_187":309,"_189":310,"_191":207,"_193":208,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":52},"sisdj0yaov9roze0fz616pp5i","Bitdefender 披露 Android GhostMap 漏洞，重启循环仅能通过恢复出厂设置解除","Bitdefender 发现 Android OS 的 GhostMap 漏洞，畸形 ZIP 条目中的压缩方式和声明的未压缩长度会被错误处理，读取时可触发 SIGBUS。","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/ghostmap-bug-android-phones-stuck/","2026-11-05T10:15:00.000Z","ytzdcdfugpd0nnciko21ou59j","Synology DSM 身份认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-13639 已复现并被勒索软件利用","Synology DSM 身份认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-13639 已被 C3RB3R / L0CK3D 勒索软件用于初始入侵，奇安信 CERT 已完成复现。","奇安信 CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247508031&idx=1&sn=be47d2b6316db564dc261a0d5a42bcd1","2026-11-05T11:48:00.000Z",{"_180":311,"_57":312,"_183":313,"_185":314,"_187":315,"_189":316,"_191":-5,"_195":198,"_197":198,"_200":62},{"_180":298,"_57":299,"_183":300,"_185":212,"_187":301,"_189":214,"_191":215,"_193":216,"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":50},{"_180":292,"_57":293,"_183":294,"_185":295,"_187":296,"_189":297,"_191":-5,"_195":196,"_197":198},"leadParagraph",{"_322":323,"_324":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
